Pi-DOS: Make CRT video diagnostics an opt-in startup setting.

[sdl] videodiagnostics=false skips mode tracing and presentation queries.
Enabling it selects VIDEO.LOG when no explicit general logfile is configured.
The mode selection correction remains active independently of diagnostics.

